Package: pelagos
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${pelagos:Python}, libc6, adduser, openssl
Recommends: bind9, bind9-utils, kea-dhcp4-server
Suggests: kea-dhcp6-server, kea-dhcp-ddns-server
Description: DNS and DHCP management for BIND 9 and Kea
 Pelagos manages BIND 9 zones and Kea DHCP subnets, reservations and leases
 through a web interface and a REST API, with replication between nodes.
 The engines stay the source of truth: zones are read by AXFR and written by
 signed dynamic updates, Kea is driven through its control sockets.
 .
 This package installs the node (web process and collector) under
 /opt/pelagos with its own Python environment. BIND and Kea are not pulled in:
 install them from the distribution or let "pelagos install" do it.
